      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Case in point: https://i.imgur.com/6BHKj5s.png\n\nThis was a good review, with a downright *ridiculous* number of issues in these worlds. These worlds were rejected for good reason. 269 dynamic bones? Yikes.\n\nBut then you scroll down a bit, and find reviews probably done by volunteers over the weekend: https://i.imgur.com/1rZ3LkN.png\n\nAs you can see, a pretty immense difference in quality. Now it *could* be that there truly were no issues in *any* of these worlds, but I doubt it. At least two of these world names would never be approved normally under the new guidelines (cropped because I don't want to witch hunt).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
