      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I know someone who tells people to upload their worlds on a certain day because there's a better chance it will actually get assigned to the proper category. I think things such as these should indeed be consistent. Quality control should be done by a single standard, not double, not triple or however many people review worlds.\nI also enter plenty of worlds in VR that are near-unbearable, so the fact that people without VR supposedly test these things also blows my mind.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
